  Result: The bug causing incorrect exception when a single message dictionary is passed to the OpenAI API model is fixed. Now the code wraps a single dict message into a list before checking for role and content keys. I ran pytest and no tests failed, indicating the fix didn't break existing functionality. You can now pass a single message dict to the model without error.
